  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Failure is not the problem. You could be the problem.",
      "start": 1.23,
      "end": 5.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me explain really quickly.",
      "start": 7.23,
      "end": 9.23
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I think that there is a part of you hidden deep inside with the hidden strength.",
      "start": 9.75,
      "end": 14.95
    },
    {
      "text": "The ability to create whatever kind of life that you imagine, the life that you are meant to live and",
      "start": 15.53,
      "end": 22.93
    },
    {
      "text": "deserve where you have the relationships that you desire.",
      "start": 22.93,
      "end": 26.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Husband, wife, boyfriend, girlfriend, they respect and love from them that makes you feel all ooey-gooey inside.",
      "start": 26.97,
      "end": 34.59
    },
    {
      "text": "I",
      "start": 35.53,
      "end": 36.17
    },
    {
      "text": "think that there's that power hidden inside and the key to attaining that power is this simple",
      "start": 36.17,
      "end": 41.25
    },
    {
      "text": "realization we're going to talk about today where you realize that there's no such thing as failure.",
      "start": 41.25,
      "end": 47.69
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no such thing as an obstacle.",
      "start": 48.61,
      "end": 51.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Because those obstacles that seem like failure,",
      "start": 52.05,
      "end": 55.11
    },
    {
      "text": "they are the opportunities in your life and",
      "start": 55.61,
      "end": 58.61
    },
    {
      "text": "the reason that this is so important is because if you believe in failure, if you believe that they're the",
      "start": 60.42,
      "end": 66.6
    },
    {
      "text": "obstacles that are holding you back,",
      "start": 66.6,
      "end": 68.84
    },
    {
      "text": "then you're going to have a really hard time creating that life. You're going to needlessly struggle for a very long time.",
      "start": 68.94,
      "end": 75.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're going to tap into what's called the mage.",
      "start": 76.46,
      "end": 80.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The mage is a part of you with that transformational power and",
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 84.54
    },
    {
      "text": "the reason that's important is because that power doesn't come from something",
      "start": 85.4,
      "end": 88.56
    },
    {
      "text": "external. It doesn't come from the money, the relationships or the respect.",
      "start": 89.3,
      "end": 94.56
    },
    {
      "text": "The power comes from internal, that mage, that can transform something that",
      "start": 95.54,
      "end": 101.2
    },
    {
      "text": "somebody else would see as",
      "start": 101.2,
      "end": 103.18
    },
    {
      "text": "failure and transform it into your best opportunity, the opportunity of a lifetime.",
      "start": 103.18,
      "end": 109.34
    }
  ]
}